# docs/fleet/scripts/fleet_update.py apply runs these commands, and only these, without a password:
# the three OS updates, then apt-mark hold and unhold of each listed app's package around the
# upgrade while that app runs. `fleet_update.py sudoers` renders the account, repeats the last
# line once per apt-mark command of the apps setup/versions.json lists, and prints its install command.
@USER@ ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/apt-get update, /usr/bin/apt-get upgrade -y, /usr/bin/snap refresh
@USER@ ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: @APT_MARK@
